<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">2 Ɔkɔrɛtiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ɔkɔrɛtiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Ɔkɔrɛtiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Okor</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kwupu Ungwopo Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba OKORETI</para>
  <para style="imt1">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu ungwu Ɔpɔlu ungwopo kwɔlɛ ungwu a ka laa enzu umba Ɔkɔrɛti le o ka ngwu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ inzumbeshi iyi Ɔpɔlu mbala ɔshɔshi uwu Ɔkɔrɛti i gyi i tutumo bwe. Enzu umbafo mu ɔshɔshi awu o so iso iyira gyɔɔ mu reshi ingyi Ɔpɔlu. Tetete Ɔpɔlu a zɔ igyimawu iyi ilomesu akwɛyi a mwɔnyɛ gyɔɔ tabɔkɔ o lomesu. Mu iyemo iyi kwupu kwɔlɛ Ɔpɔlu e so iso meka iyi luzɛ wu mbala ɔshɔshi uwu Ɔkɔrɛti, opwu uwu bɔkɔ a gba meka iyi ikama yɛyɛ mbala evyo iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu ɔshɔshi awu. A zɔ ɔnyɛ wu tee opwu igbamawu ɔnwu u bo la itamɛzhi mbala ilomesu. Akwɛyi a kpamba ɛshɛkwu tee lo kpala eduwo ɛlu kaa mbwama laa Wambwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi igɔ mu Ozhudiya. Mu imbwama iyi kwupu kwɔlɛ, a gbɔ ɛnwu ma tee uwu akwu uzilɔ shɛ, moo enzu umbafo bwe mu Ɔkɔrɛti ɔ bɔ emba tee mba gba akwu wazilɔ shɛ le Ɔpɔlu ba akwu uzilɔ uwangba.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Mɛmi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu iyemo (1.1-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔpɔlu mbala ɔshɔshi uwu Ɔkɔrɛtiya (1.12-7.16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Reshi iwomo laa Wambwalu mu Ozhudiya (8.1-9.15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔpɔlu a gbɔ ɛnwu ma meka iyi ɛduma wu iyi uzilɔ (10.1-13.10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama iyi iso (13.11-13).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Ɛlɛ akwu imi Ɔpɔlu onzu u zilɔ iyi ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mu inyama iyi Ukpo, mbala umanyi nzu Otimoti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Ki kakwupu kwɔlɛ ki ka yi lunyi enzu umba ɔshɔshi uwu Ɔkɔrɛti mbala enzu umba Ukpo lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Akaya:<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Ukpo ete nzu mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi Ɔkwu nzu le shi yi esheshi mbala idigbomo.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Gbɛlɛ Ukpo Ɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />La ki du Ukpo ete wu Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi ma, Ada uwu bɔkɔ a ma eyembembyi nzu, Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e shi nzu egbo mɛzhi lɛɛbi awu. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Ukpo ele gba e gbo nzu idu mo mu inyashi nzu lɛɛbi, kaa umba bɔkɔ o yi mu inyashi imama awu, kinzu tete la ki gbo mbo idu mo mu idigbomo iyi bɔkɔ ki fya mbaa Ukpo awu. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Moo ta bɔkɔ inyashi iyi Okrasi i du nzu awu, te gba idigbomo iyi Okrasi i zɛ ma nzu le tete. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Akwiyi gba kinzu ki ma inyashi akwu kwuwo yi, kaa la lu fya idigbomo mbala isama le; Akwiyi gba Ukpo e gbo nzu idu mo, akwu kwuwo yi, kaa la lu fya idigbomo tete, akwɛyi lu yidu mbala idu kwɔku mu inyashi imama kyamate kinzu te. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Moo kinzu ki shi egbo ma yi ngiri, kyamate bɔkɔ lu ma inyashi mbala nzu awu, te gba lu fya idigbomo mbala nzu le tete.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi ki gyi te la lu yitu iyi inyashi iyi bɔkɔ ki ma mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya awu. Inyashi ɛnyi i ga nzu ma, kinzu lala ki yitu te ki ŋi yi kwunyɔ fo. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Mu egbo nzu i yi te o ranzu o ta la lukwu kego. Ɛlɛ ba i wo te kaa la ki fulo idu mu ɛnwu nzu mo, la ki fulo idu mu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ ee shi enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo kwunyɔ awu. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a wanzu ma mu riyi ingyi lukwu undura awu, uwu gba a sa nzu ma le. Ki shi egbo mawu kpɔ te a sa nzu ma ngbɛɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Lunyi la lu mbwa nzu ma mu Ukpo ilɛma, akwɛyi Ukpo a pwa yi, ba ee shi nzu esheshi wu, inyi ii shi enzu gyɔɔ ɔ du wu ma.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Gba Laa Amasa Ikama Iyi Luzɛ Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Kiya ingyi ki bɔma mangyi gba akwu tee: Egbo nzu i za nzu te ki zɛ luzɛ marimari mbala yi mu egbo ikpɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ i ngyi mbaa Ukpo awu. Ukpo gba e shi nzu ekpasu kaa la ki wo ɛlɛ le, moo akwu amasa iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mo. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Moo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu wa ngyi kego bɔkɔ lu zɔngɔma ngyi ma gba ki ka ki ka yi le. Imi ba mi shi egbo tee, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />tabɔkɔ lu du mbwa nzu izɔngɔma mo awu, kwuye ba kwu yi mu inyɔma bɔkɔ lu zɔngɔma nzu ma akwɛyi lu bɔma ma nzu, kyamate bɔkɔ ki bi bɔma ma yi mu kwɔfyi ungwu igbama ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi Ɔkwu nzu tayi.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Kwuwongwu mi yi egbo ɛlɛ shɛ awu, mi gyi te la mi bo munyi yi keyi dɛ ka la lu fya esheshi izhepo. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Mi ka te mi nyɔ kaa la mi ma yi dɛ kwuyengwu mi sheye mu Omasedoniya, mi gba mi zɛ munyi yi kpɔ mu igbama mi, kaa la mi fya imbwama munyi yi akwɛyi mi zɛ mi re mu Ozhudiya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ mi ka amasa ɛlɛ awu mi to yi la ɛnɛ mo, nana mi ka yi mate enzu umba bɔkɔ o yitu iyi Ukpo mo awu mo, bɔkɔ oo za ŋa te, &lt;&lt;Ee,Ee&gt;&gt; mu egbo mbo ba akwu &lt;&lt;Ayimo&gt;&gt; awu.<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Mate bɔkɔ Ukpo akwu u wo ongbulolo awu, iso iyi ki so yi ele akwu iso iyi kwu kyoro mo. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Moo Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi umɛ uwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ imi mbala Osalasi mbala Otimoti ki ta yi anu wu awu, akwu onzu uwu kwukyoro mo. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Moo iso ribariba iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi awu, kpɛkpɛyi i nyɔlɔma mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. Mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi gba ki zɔ te &lt;&lt;Li yi tayi&gt;&gt; le akwɛyi Ukpo a fya iduma. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Ukpo gba e shi te kinzu mbala yi la ki rima ngiri mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi imbwaluma le, akwɛyi a ŋa nzu lɛwu, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />akwɛyi e wo nzu kɛzɔ kaa la ki kwu umba wu, akwɛyi e shi kwundu wu mu egbo nzu kaa la ki yitu te iyi bɔkɔ e so e shi mɛzhi kpiri awu ee wo yi mo.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Ukpo akwu uzɔgɔ mi te akwu kwuwongu kaa la mi lo yi inyashi fo, gba mi gba mi zɛ mu Ɔkɔrɛti mo le. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Akwu te ki kpa yi mɛga mu iyi lu mbwalu mo, kinzu ba ki wo ɛduma kya mbala yi kaa la lu yi ɔnyɛ, moo akwu mu ikwu idu lu fulo yi gba lu rima ngiri le.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba mi ka mu egbo mi te mi gba mi re munyi yi kaa la mi shi yi ubu ugyi fo le. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Moo akwiyi gba mi shi yi ubu ugyi, uwe bɔkɔ e shi mi mi mwɔnyɛ kpɔ? Akwu lunyi gba mi shi yi ubu ugyi le. <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Kwuwo Kwɔngwu gba mi kakwupu mi ka yi le, lunyi umba bɔkɔ i fate la lu kwu ɔnyɛ mi le, mi gyi te kaa la mi fya ubugyi mbala yi kwuye mi bo mo. Moo imi mi yitu te gba mi yi ɔnyɛ, lɛɛbi yi lu yi ɔnyɛ tete. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Egbo mi i tutu mo gyɔɔ bɔkɔ mi ye yi mu kwupu kwɔlɛ ikama la ɛnyɛ le, akwu kwuwongu kaa la mi shi yi ubugyi le mo, akwu te kaa la lu yitu te imi mi pwu idɛnyi yi gyɔɔ.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igba Yi Kpa La Onzu Uwu E Ngbomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Akwiyi gba onzu a ka yi la ubugyi, ubugyi uwayi a ka uwa mi ma. Iso iyi mi so yi ele mi kyo yi mo mo. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Inyashi iyi bɔkɔ enzu riba o lo wu awu i kpo wo kya. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu gba yi kpa wu akwɛyi la lu yi wu lu kpa midu kaa ubu ugyi la ngbɛ wu ma mo. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Mii kpa yi ɛshɛku te la lu wo kaa onzu awu le yitu te lu pwu idɛnyi wu. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Mi ka yi kwupu kwɔngu kaa la mi pwa yi ma le, shi lu mbwalu iso mi naa lu mbwalu mo ŋa. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Akwiyi gba lu gba la ingbomo lu kpa onzu uwunawuna, imi mi gba yi mi kpa wu tete. Akwiyi gba mi gba yi kpa wu kwuwo yi, akwu kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />kwuwongu kaa onzu uwoyi la shiri nzu ma mo. Moo ki yitu iyi ɔrɔ wu.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aka Itama Iyi Ɔpɔlu Mu Otorowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ mi fye mu Oturowa kaa la mi tanu iyi ilɔ iyesheshi iyi Okrasi, akwɛyi mi ma te Ɔkwu nzu a wu mi ɔgwuzɛ ma. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Tabɔkɔ mi ma umɛnɛ mi Ɔtayitɔ mɔmɔ mo awu, idu i gbo mi mo mo akwɛyi mi wo mbo ungbo akwɛyi mi ka mu Omasedoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Irimo I Zɛ Mu Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Ukpo gba ki gbɛlɛ wu ɛnyi le kwuwongu bɔkɔ e shi nzu kaa la ki kpa mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kaa la ki mwɔnyɛ mbala umba bɔkɔ o byi ma mu ewa, akwɛyi e shi iyitu iyawu kaa li zɛ ma nzu kaa li fye munamuna la umbwɔ ferere kyamate oturare tayi. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Ukpo a ra nzu e wo kyamate kiya ingyi umbwɔ ferere ingyi Okrasi la enzu umba bɔkɔ o sa mba ma mbala umba bɔkɔ o yi mu itomo. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Mbaa enzu umba ingbomo, ki yi kyamate kiya ingyi umbwɔ fuu umbu lukwu tayi, mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o sa mba ma ba ki yi kyamate kiya ingyi umbwɔ ferere umbu kwunyɔ tayi. Uwe bɔkɔ e do ɛlɛ iwomo? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Kinzu ki tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo kyamate enzu umba bɔkɔ o gyi kwule awu mo, ki zɛ ilɔ iyi Ukpo mu egbo ikpɛnyi kyamate enzu umba bɔkɔ Okrasi a lɔ mba ma tayi.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Ɛmɛgba Umba Iso I Shimɛzhi Iyepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />La lu ma te kinzu ki gyi te la ki pwɔ ɛnwu nzu ma mo, ugɔ ba a kpa nzu kaa lo kakwupu ungwu izɔma lo ka yi nana kwupu lakwu wɔ munyi nzu kyamate umbafo tayi mo. <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Lunyi lu yi kyamate kwupu ungwu bɔkɔ o ka ngwu ma mu egbo nzu tayi, enzu umbanambana oo wa akwɛyi ɔ zɔngɔma yi ma. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Lunyi lunyi kyamate kwupu ungwu bɔkɔ Okrasi a ka bɔkɔ a lɔ nzu ma tayi, akwu mu embyi umba keshi gba o ka le mo, o ra la Kwundu uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e yi la reyi gba o ka le, ba akwu te o ka yi mu kwɔbɛ mo, mu egbo iyi enzu gba o ka yi le.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Kinzu ki so ɛlɛ kwuwongu ki kwu idu lu fulo mu Ukpo meka iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Akwu te ki yi ekpasu iyi kiya kinyinyi iwomo la ɛnzu le mo, ekpasu nzu i wɔ mbaa Ukpo. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />E shi nzu ekpasu kaa la ki wo ɛduma iyi kenzu igyirima ungepo, moo akwu ɛrama iyi Omosisi iyi bɔkɔ o ka yi ma awu mo, akwu iyi Kwundu; Ɛrama i bo la lukwu, Kwundu ba e shi onzu kwunyɔ.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o shi Omosisi ɛrama iyi o ka yi mu kwoki kwu pɛtɛkɛ awu, i bo la inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo, ilemo yi eyi iyi Omosisi iyi bɔkɔ iyi mu isɛma-a lala enzu umba Izirɛ o yese yi ego mo, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo gba e to keyi yi le, i yi inzumbɛku i ka le moo? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Ɛduma iyi ɛrama iyi Omosisi iyi bɔkɔ i bo la lukwu lala i yi inzumbɛku, i bi gyi ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ i bo la isama! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Tabɔkɔ iyi i ka inzumbɛku ma i bo, inzumbɛku iyekyi ɛnyi i kama. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Moo gba iyi bɔkɔ i sɛma le i yi inzumbɛku te, iyi bɔkɔ i sɛma mo i ka inzumbɛku le mo?<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Kwuwongwu ki yi eyi ifulomo ɛlɛ te awu, gba ki wiyi mo le. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Kinzu ki yi kyamate Omosisi mo, uwu bɔkɔ a wɛ kiya meyi kaa ɛmɛ umba Izirɛ lo ma eyi wu iyi bɔkɔ iyi mu i sɛma awu mo. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Ta ɔnɛ te egbo mbo i yi ipwu kpɔ, moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o wa ekpo iyi kenzu igyirima ungekyi, o zɔngɔma yi ma mo. Moo mu Okrasi gba eyi i wuma le. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Ta ɔnɛ te gba o wa ɛrama iyi Omosisi ma, o zɔngɔma yi ma mo, moo kiya ki wɛ mu egbo mbo i degbo kpɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o gba o mbwalu Ukpo ɔnɛ te ba ipwu i pyama mu egbo mbo. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Moo Ukpo akwu Kwundu, munamuna bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi, a wa la enzu mo mu rinye. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Akwɛyi kinzu umba bɔkɔ eyi nzu i yi mu ipwu fo le, ki zɔ inzumbɛku iyi Ɔkwu ma ŋa, kinzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo nzu kyamate ɛnwu wu te awu, mu inzumbɛku iyɛku iyi bɔkɔ i ngyi mba Ɔkwu uwu bɔkɔ akwu Kwundu awu.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Apula Iyeshi Iyi Kwundu Mɛmi Iyi Lu wu Undu Lo mbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ ta bɔkɔ Ukpo a ma eyembembyi nzu akwɛyi a ra la ɛduma ɛlɛ e shi nzu le, egbo nzu i pulama mo. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Kinzu ki lafya la ɛgwuzɛ iyi invyemo mbala iyi eseye; Ki wo kiya ingyi kwukyoro mo, ba ki yoro iso iyi Ukpo mo mu kiya ingyifo mo. Kiya ingyi ki wo gba akwu te, ki wa la ongbulolo uwu Ukpo kwudu kaa uwewe la ma yi mu egbo wu midu iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Ilɔ iyesheshi nzu ɛlɛ invyemo mo, mɔgɔ wu enzu mba bɔkɔ o yi mu itomo gba invye mo le. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Onzu uwoyi uwu bɔkɔ akwu ɔsu uwu kwushi kwɔlɛ awu, e koko eyi iyi mba bɔkɔ o mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi ma kaa lo ma ɛbɛ iyi ilɔ iyesheshi iyi inzumbɛku iyi Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ akwu kya mbala Ukpo awu mo. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Moo anu iyi ki ta le akwu iyanzu mo, akwiyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ akwu Ɔkwu le, kinzu ba ki kwu ɛmɛgba yi kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Moo Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɛbɛ li wɔ meka iyi ipwu kaa li lemo,&gt;&gt; awu gba e shi kaa ɛbɛ wu li lemo mu egbo nzu kaa li shi nzu ɛbɛ iyi iyitu iyi inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo mu ɛduma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi le.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Kinzu ba ki yi ilɔ iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ i yi kyamate kiya ingyeshi te, iyi bɔkɔ i yi meka nzu umba ki yi kyamate kɛwu unga lo mbo te le, ɛlɛ i zɔ te ekpasu iyi i gama ɛlɛ i ngyi mbaa Ukpo moo akwu mbaa onzu mo. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />O kpa nzu ma iyɛkɔkɔ mu kwuko ungwunanguna, ba o shɛkɛ nzu ma mo; Ki lomo zhigaa, ba ki wiyi mo; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />O lo nzu inyashi, Ukpo ba a lu nzu afyima mo; O kpa nzu apula ba ki kpomo mo. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Ki koko ki yi mu kwumbɛ ungwu lukwu kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi , kaa kwunyɔ wu la kwu zɔ mu ɛnwu nzu tete. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Moo kinzu umba bɔkɔ ki yi la reyi le, o ra nzu o shi iyɔkpɔɔ kaa lo ngbɛ nzu ma kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi, kaa luzɛ undu Ɔzhizɔsi la lu zɔ mu luzɛ nzu tete. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, lukwu lu yi mu ɛduma iwomo ma nzu, kwunyɔ ba kwu yi mu ɛduma iwomo meka yi.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te: &lt;&lt; Imi mi kwu idu lu fulo mawu; Gba i shi mi siso le.&gt;&gt; Mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔwu gba kinzu ki shi egbo nzu akwɛyi ki siso le, <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Moo ki yitu te Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e yi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi ma mu lukwu awu, ee yi kinzu mbala yi ma tete kyamate bɔkɔ e yi Ɔzhizɔsi ma awu akwɛyi a nya nzu midu wu. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Ɛlɛ lɛɛbi akwu kwuwo yi, kaa esheshi iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu ifulama mbaa enzu munamuna awu, li wo kaa enzu lo du Ukpo ma akwɛyi o gbɛlɛ wu ɛnyi gyɔɔ.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŋɔma Laa Ikwidufulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ egbo nzu imuma mo. Kwokpo ungwu ɛnwu nzu la kwu yi mu ivama tetete lala, kwundu uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e yi ma nzu le ee shi nzu ekpasu kwɔfykwɔfyi. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Moo inyashi iyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu imama le akwu iyɛri mu kwuye bwɛɛ byi, ɛlɛ gba ba i nya nzu la inzumbɛku iyɔkpɔɔ iyi bɔkɔ i ka inyashi ɛnyi ma lɛɛbi gyɔɔ le. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ ki shi egbo nzu mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ eyi i mangyi mo awu, moo akwu mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ eyi i mangyi le mo. Moo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ eyi i mangyi, aakwu ingyi kwuye bwɛɛ byi, ingyi bɔkɔ eyi i mangyi mo awu ba akwu ingyi ɔkpɔɔ.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Kinzu ki yitu te, gba o ngbɛ ɛnwu nzu ɛlɛ iyi bɔkɔ i yi kyamate kwunu tayi awu ma, Ukpo ee shi nzu kwɔgba ungwoshi ungwu bɔkɔ e mbo mu afyi wu ungwu bɔkɔ ki ŋɔ iyɔkpɔɔ, kwɔgba kwɔlɛ akwu onzu gba e mbo le mo. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Moo mu ɛnwu ɛlɛ ki koko ki bɛma te ɔnuna Ukpo e be shi nzu ɛnwu iyoshi kyamate o kpo nzu ekpayi mu ɛnwu tayi. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Kwuye ungwu Ukpo e be shi nzu ɛnwu iyoshi, ki ŋɔ la uzhi uwidɔ mo. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki yi mu ɛnwu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ kyamate kwunu awu, ki bɛma ba ki koko ki ma inyashi kwuwongu ki gyi te la ki lafya la ɛnwu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, kinzu ba ki gyi te Ukpo le shi nzu ɛnwu iyoshi kaa ɛnwu nzu iyi lukwu ɛlɛ lo shi yi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Akwu Ukpo mu afyi wu gba e wo nzu le kwuwongu kaa le shi nzu kwunyɔ ungwepo, akwɛyi e shi nzu kwundu Ɔkɛrikɛri kaa li zɔ te uwu ee wo iyi bɔkɔ a zɔ te ee wo ɔnuwu kwɔnyi kwɔlɛ awu.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kinzu ki shi egbo ki gba ki nyama te, ta bɔkɔ ki degbo mu ɛnwu nzu ɛlɛ, kinzu ki ndama shaaru mbala Ukpo. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Moo luzɛ nzu akwu mu ikwu idu lu fulo, akwu mu iyi bɔkɔ ki ye yi mu imama le mo. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Imi mi so yi kpɔ te, kinzu ki shi egbo iyɛkɔkɔ te, i she nzu i ka le gba ki lafya la ɛnwu nzu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa la ki yi mbala Edego-ala Ɔkwu nzu moshi. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, akwiyi gba ki yi mu ɛnwu nzu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ naa akwu ma yi mo, igyima nzu gba akwu te la ki wo iyi bɔkɔ i she wu. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Moo kpɛkpɛnzu kii gyirima mu idu iyi Okrasi mbaa ombu ifumo, kaa uwewe la na rigbɛ ingyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ uwu e wo, iyi bɔkɔ e wo iyeshi naa iyira mu ɛnwu ɛlɛ.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛduma Iyi I Lo Enzu Mesu Mbala Ukpo Mu Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Kwuwongwu kinzu ki wiyi iyi Ukpo awu, gba i shi ki za la enzu te lo nyama la ongbulolo le. Ukpo e yi ewo iyi bɔkɔ kinzu ki yi, lunyi tete lu yitu ewo iyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu akɔ yi. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Kinzu ki gyi te la ki gba la ki pwɔ ɛnzu ma munyi yi mo, kinzu ba ki gyi te la ki wo ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ lu fya lu kwu ɛnwu manzu, kaa lunyi la lu yi opwu uwu igbama la enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwɛnwu mu apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ moo akwu iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu egbo mbo mo. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Gba akwu kyamate rishi gba ki yi mu ikpomo le, akwu kwuwo ungwu Ukpo. Gba akwu mu iyitu nzu, de ba ki yi mu iwomo kwuwo yi. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Moo akwu kwuwo ungwu idɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi gba i shi ki wo iyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu iwomo le, kwuwongu ki yitu te ɔzɛnyi e kpomo kwuwongu enzu lɛɛbi, inyi i zɔ te enzu lɛɛbi o kpomo. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Onzu ele e kpomo kwuwongu enzu lɛɛbi, kaa enzu umba o ye la reyi lo zɛ luzɛ undu bɔkɔ ɛnwu mba i gyi kɛɛkyi fo, luzɛ mba lakwu undu lu she la Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ e kpomo, a gba la iyimo kwuwo mbo awu.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, i na mu ɔnɛ i sheye keyi, kinzu ki yese onzu mate bɔkɔ kwudu kwɔlɛ kwu yese fo. Moo kinzu mekyeki te gba ki yese Okrasi le, kekelele kinzu ki yese wu tayi fo. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, gba onzu akwu uwu Okrasi, onzu awu akwu onzu uwepo ŋa; apula iyeki i ka-a, iyepo ba i bo-o! <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Ɛlɛ kpɛkpɛyi i ngyi mbaa Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e lo nzu mesu mbala wu kwuwongu bɔkɔ ki nyama la Ɔzhizɔsi awu. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu isomo gba i yi te, Ukpo e yi mu ɔgwuzɛ iwomo kaa enzu lɛɛbi lo gba lo lomesu mbala wu kwuwongu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ Okrasi e wo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Ukpo e yi mbo ombu uwu ingbomo fo akwɛyi e shi nzu ɛduma iyi ilɔ izɛma iyi ilomesu mbala wu. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Kekelele, kinzu ki kwu ashikada umba Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, iso gba i yi te, Ukpo e yi mu enzu igagyima kwuwongu ilɔ wu iyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu izɛma le. Ki kpa yi ɛshɛku kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi te, la lu nyama kaa la lu lomesu mbala Ukpo. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e ngbomo ɔnu uwunawuna mo, Ukpo ba e wo wu onzu uwu ingbomo kwuwo nzu lɛɛbi, kaa kwuwongu imɛza nzu mbala Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi kii kwu enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a na nzu.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Kinzu umba bɔkɔ ki kyo kya mu ɛduma iwomo mbala Ukpo, ki kpa yi ɛshɛku te, esheshi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi yi awu, la lu wo ɛduma ma yi. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Kwuwongwu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">&lt;&lt;Mi gba yi opwu ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu mi gyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu isama, mi mbwa yi ma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Lalu pwa! ɔnɛ gba akwu kwɔfyi ungwu o na esheshi iyi Ukpo le, ɔnɛ gba akwu kwɔfyi ungwu lu fya isama mbaa Ukpo le!<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Kinzu ki wo kiya ingyi ki shi enzu lo lɛfyi mo, kaa onzu la fya kwuyi ungwu a ma ingbomo mu ɛduma iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu iwomo le mo. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Kinzu umba bɔkɔ ki wo ɛduma iyi Ukpo awu ba ki zɔ enzu te ki kwu enzu umba ongbulolo mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna: mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu idu kwɔku mbala kwuye ungwu ovyo mbala mu inyashi imama mbala mu kwuye ungwu ira. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />o kpa nzu ɛmu; o ta nzu mu ugu ugyi; o kpalashi nzu o nɛ nzu lunɛ; la ɛduma iwomo iyɛkɔkɔ, ki nyi enzu ondo mo mbala kiya ingyirimo; <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />mu iŋɔma iyi ɔsɛsɛ; mu kiya izɔngɔma gedegede; mu idu iyimo mbala esheshi iwomo la enzu; mu imbwama iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo mbala idɛnyi ipwumo ireyi; <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />mu isomo nzu iyi ongbulolo mbala ekpasu iyi Ukpo; ki yi ototo kyamate ewulo iyi ewa zu tayi mu ungyi mu ɔzu. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />O pwɔ nzu ma ba o zhi nzu ma; o kpa zu ari ba o du zu ma.O ya nzu te wa mulo, munɛ ba ongbulolo gba ki yi mu isomo le; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />enzu umbafo o zɔ te o yitu nzu mo munɛ ba enzu o yitu nzu gedegede, mu kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ enzu o fulo eyi te ki kpomo, munɛ ba ki ye la reyi. o kpa nzu ɛmu ba o ngbɛ nzu ma mo; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Ki yi ubugyi munɛ ba ki kwu enzu umba ɔnyɛ kwuye ungwunanguna; ki kwu ayirewa, munɛ ba ki shi enzu o yi kiya ingyi kwuwo; enzu o ma nzu te ki yi kiya mo munɛ ba ki yi ingyinangyina.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Lunyi wa mbwalu umba Ɔkɔrɛti, kinzu ki so yi iso mu egbo ikpɛnyi, idɛnyi iyayi mu akɔ nzu ba i yi ibɔma mo. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Idɛnyi iya yi mu akɔ nzu i gyima mo, idɛnyi iya nzu mu akɔ yi gba i yi mu igyima le. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Imi mi so yi iso kyamate imi mi kwu ete yi tayi, lunyi la lu pwu idɛnyi nzu kyamate te ki pwu iya yi tayi; la lu pwu idɛnyi nzu gyɔɔ mu akɔ yi tete.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lalu Gɔ Kya Mbala Enzu Umba Bɔkɔ Akwu Wambwalu Mo Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />La lu lo mesu kya mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu mo mo. Moo ɔgwuzɛ uwu enzu umba ototo u zɛ kya mbala ɔgwuzɛ uwu enzu umbu ira mo! Tete ipwu i gɔ kɛlɛ mbaa ɛbɛ mo! <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />I wo te bɔkɔ Okrasi a nyama la onzu uwoyi? Kimbe ki shi ba u mbwalu a kpakya mbala u mbwalu mo? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Ɔtɛpu uwu Ukpo a kpakya mbala kwunu ungwu eshi mo. Moo kinzu ki yi kyamate Ɔtɛpu uwu Ukpo tayi. Mate bɔkɔ Ukpo e so mekyeki te: &lt;&lt;Imi mi ŋɔ mbala mba, mi gba mi gɔ mbala mba, akwɛyi mi kwu Ukpo mba, umba ba aakwu enzu mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Ɔkwu a zɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Lalu wɔma munyi mba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">kaa lalu ŋɔ kɛrɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Lalu pwu afyi mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi i nyima mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">akwɛyi Imi ba mi na yi ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />&lt;&lt;Imi mii kwu eteyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">lunyi ba luu kwu ɛmɛ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">te gba Ɔkwu Edego ala e so le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Ɛmɛza mi, ta bɔkɔ ki yi iso iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi la nzu le, la ki lafya la apula iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ i zhi ɛnwu nzu mbala kwundu nzu ɛnyinyi. La ki wo ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ ii shi ki kwu enzu umba ɔkɛrikɛri umba bɔkɔ o yi iyi iyi Ukpo.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔnyɛ Uwu Ɔpɔlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />La lu pwu idɛnyi nzu mu akɔ yi iyɛkɔkɔ. Kinzu ki ngbomo la onzu uwufo mo mo, kinzu ki shi onzu uwufo a tama mo, kinzu ki kyoro onzu uwufo mo te le shi nzu eduwo mo. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Iso iyi mi so yi ele, akwu te mi gyi te la mi za yi te lunyi lu wo iyira le mo; kinzu ki so yi keyi dɛɛ te ki pwu idɛnyi yi mu akɔ nzu gyɔɔ, ki za yi te kinzu ki lu yi afyima gbee mo. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Imi mi shi egbo ma yi te lu wo ongbulolo kwuwongu mi kwu ɛnwu ma yi. Mu inyashi lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu imama le, ɛnwu mi i ka mi ma gyɔɔ ba mi yi ɔnyɛ uwakwu mu akɔ mi.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki bo mu Omasedoniya awu, ɛnwu i gbo nzu mo mo, kinzu ki ma inyashi mu ɛgwuzɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ: Iyi kwonze agewa nzu o towo nzu mo, iyopo iyi i nyɔlɔ nzu ma. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ukpo uwu a ka enzu umba bɔkɔ ɛnwu mba imuma ɛnwu ma awu ba a ka nzu ɛnwu ma kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔtayitɔ e bo munyi nzu, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />akwu ibomo wu kɛɛkyi mo, ɛnwu ɛɛkɔ iyi bɔkɔ a fya munyi yi awu, ɛlɛ i kyo i ka nzu ɛnwu ma tete. A za nzu te lu yi mu eyi ifulomo te kaa la lu ma mi, a za nzu te egbo yi i fomo gyɔɔ kwuwongu apula iyi bɔkɔ lu wo mu afyi iyi kembo awu, e so nzu te lu gyi rɛnu mi gyɔɔ, ɛlɛ i shi ɔnyɛ mi uwu kekelele a ka le.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Akwiyi gba kwupu ungwu mi ka yi awu kwu wo yi ubu ofya, Imi mi shi ɛmi kwungbɛ mo. Tetete imi mi shi ɛmi kwungbɛ bwɛɛ kwuwongu kwupu ungwu mi ka yi ele, moo mi yitu te kwu wo yi ubwu ofya iyi kwuye bwɛɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Imi kekelele mi yi ubwu uruwu, akwu kwuwogu te mi shi yi lu wo ubwu ofya le mo, akwu kwuwongu ubwu ofya yi ele e shi yi lu ta mɛzhi. Ubwu ofya uwu lu wo awu, akwu mu igyima iyi Ukpo, kwuwo kwɔlɛ kinzu ki wo yi kiya ingyi ubwu ofya mo ndii. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Moo ubugyi uwu bɔkɔ akwu mu inyama iyi Ukpo, ee shi enzu o gba la luzɛ undepo izɛma undu lu bo la isama, kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ɛngbɛ ishimo mu ɛlɛ te i yi mo. Enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o wo ubugyi uwu bɔkɔ i ka mba la lukwu. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Lunyi la lu yese esheshi iyi bɔkɔ ubwu ofya uwu bɔkɔ lu wo mu inyama iyi Ukpo a ka yi : Lu bɔ kwushi mu ongbulolo imbwaluma, lu zɔ enzu te lu kwu enzu umba ira mo, lu wo amba kwuwongu ingbomo iyi bɔkɔ lu ngbo, la iyi iyi bɔkɔ lu wo, la iwomo iyi lu gyi te la lu ma mi, la igyakpɔɔ iyi lu gyi te la lu mbwalu iso mi, akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o ngbomo lu zɔ mba rɛnu. Mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna lu zɔ ɛnwu yi te lu yi ɔsɛkɛnɛ mu ombu ɔlɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kwupu ungwu mi ka yi awu, akwu kwuwongu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e ngbomo awu mo naa kwuwongu onzu uwu bɔkɔ o ngbo wu mo awu mo, imi mi ka yi kwupu kwɔngu kaa la lu zɔngɔma yi ma gedegede mu idu iyi Ukpo te lunyi lu mbwa nzu ma gyɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Iwomo ɛlɛ i ka nzu ɛnwu ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">A kwu ɛlɛ kɛɛkyi mo, ɔnyɛ nzu akwu uwakwu kwuwongu Ɔtayitɔ e yi mu ɔnyɛ kwuwongu lunyi lu ka wu ɛnwu ma akwɛyi egbo wu i shi mɛzhi. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Moo kenze mi kwu ɛnwu ma yi mu idu wu akwɛyi lunyi ba lu lo mi lovya mo. Iso iyi bɔkɔ mi so yi lɛɛbi awu te gba i yi le, kwuwo kwɔlɛ ɛnwu iyi ki kwu kwuwo yi la Ɔtayitɔ awu, akwu kyaa. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Kekelele, e pwu idɛnyi yi a ka le ŋa gba e lolo te lunyi lɛɛbi lu lomo la iso wu, ta bɔkɔ l u na wu mu ewo epo mbala ilomo. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Imi mi yi ɔnyɛ kwuwongu mi shi egbo te lu do iyinayina lɛɛbi iwomo ɔnyɛnyɛ.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Rɛshi Iwomo Ingyi Wambwalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Ɛmɛmbɛnɛ mi, ki gyi te la lu yitu iyi esheshi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi ɔshɔshi uwu kwuse ungwu Omasedoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />O pwa mba ma, o lo mbo inyashi mu ɛgwuzɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ, la rewa mba mbala inyashi mba, tetete ɛlɛ i nyi mba rɛshi iwomo laa ɔnyɛ mu egbo ikpɛnyi mo. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Moo mi so yi te o shi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o yi ngyi lɛɛbi, ingyi bɔkɔ o shi le lala ri ka ingyi bɔkɔ enzu o fulo eyi mo. O shi ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mu egbo mbo ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />O kpa nzu ɛshɛku te la ki shi mbo kapa kaa umba tete lo lo kwuwo mu ɛduma ɛlɛ, iyi imbwama laa wa mbwalu umba kwuse ungwu Ozhudiya ma. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Ɛlɛ i ka nzu meyi, moo i yi kwonze o to ɛnwu mba o shi Ɔkwu keyi dɛ akwɛyi mu inyama iyi Ukpo o ra la ɛnwu mba o shi nzu tete. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Akwu kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba ki za la Ɔtayitɔ te le so wu mu ɛduma iyi rɛshi inama mbaa wa mbwalu, moo uwu gba e ye la ɛduma ɛnyi iwomo le. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Kyamate bɔkɔ lu wo marimari mu ikwu idu lu fulo, mu iso isomo, mu ilukwu, mu igyakpɔɔ mbala mu idɛnyi iyanzu awu, la lu kyakpɔ kaa la lu wo marimari mu rɛshi iwomo tete.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Imi mi ye yi mu ɔkpa itama mo, imi mi gyi te la mi zɔ yi te umbafo gyɔɔ o yi mu igyakpɔɔ te umba tete lo mbwama, ɛlɛ gba i zɔ te idɛnyi yi akwu mu egbo ikpɛnyi naa akwu mu egbo ikpɛnyi mo ŋa. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Moo lunyi lu yitu iyi esheshi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. U wu akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi kiya ingyinaingyina moshi ɔbulɛ ŋa kwuwo nzu a vindɔ ɔyirewa kaa kwuwongu rewa wu kaa la fya kiya ingyinaingyina mbaa Ukpo.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ mi ta yi amasa te: Ishoshi kaa la lu mbwa ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ lu ye kanu awu ma, akwu kwuwongu bɔkɔ lu kwu enzu umba kwonze mu ishimo le kɛɛkyi mo, ikyo kwuwongu lu yi yi mu egbo yi te lu wo tayi le. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Kekelele lunyi la lu mbwa ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ lu ye awu ma, kaa li zɔ igyikpɔɔ yi mu ɛduma ɛnyi imbwama. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Gba onzu e yi egbo iyi bɔkɔ e shi rɛshi, Ukpo a na rɛshi ngyɛngyi ma kwuwongu e shi mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e yi ngyi mu egbo ikpɛnyi, moo akwu mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e yi ngyi mo mo.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Mi ye mu isomo te lalu fulo ɛnwu yi ewulo kaa la lu gyi iyi enzu umbafo ma mo. Imi mi gyi te ewulo yi la lu ka yi ma kyakya. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Mu kwuye kwɔlɛ apula yi iyi bɔkɔ lu yi yi gyɔɔ awu la lu ka yi ma mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi igɔ, akwɛyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lunyi lu yi igɔ umba tete o ka iyi bɔkɔ umba o yi yi gyɔɔ awu ma mbala yi. Mu iwomo ɛlɛ te i shi onzonzu a fya kiya kyakya. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Kyamate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so te: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a kpala ɛlu gyɔɔ e yi ngyi gyɔɔ mo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a kpala ɛlu bwɛɛ ba e yi ngyi bwɛɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔtayitɔ Mbala Ɛmɛza wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Mi gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuwongu egbo iyi Ɔtayitɔ mbala iya mi, i yi kya mbaa imbwama iya yi. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Ki za wu te le so munyi yi akwɛyi a nyama, uwu mafyi wu i yi mu egbo wu kaa le so munyi yi keyi dɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Ki lɔ umɛnɛ uwufo uwu bɔkɔ ɛshɔshi lɛɛbi i lo wu mo kwuwongu ɛduma iyi anu itama wu awu kaa la zɛ mbala wu. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Akwu ɛnyi kɛɛkyi mo, ɛshɔshi lɛɛbi ba i ŋa wu kaa la zɛ mbala nzu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki re laa rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ o shi awu kaa li inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo kaa li zɔ te ki yi egbo iyi imbwama. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Ki gyi te la ki wo bɛtɛ kaa enzu lo pe nzu ari kwuyengwu rɛshi ngyɛngyi ikama mo. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Moo iya nzu gba akwu te la ki wo ingyi bɔkɔ ki shoshi, lakwu mbaa Ɔkwu nzu kɛɛkyi mo, lakwu mbaa enzu tete.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ki lɔ umanyi nzu ma kaa la zɛ mbala mba. Ki pwa wu ma kwuye riba riba akwɛyi ki ma te e yi egbo iyi imbwama. Kekelele ba e fulo eyi ma yi, inyi gba i kyo wu ekpasu ma kaa la mbwama mu ɛduma ɛlɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Ɔtayitɔ akwu onzu u kpa mi lɛnwu mbala u wo ɛduma mbala mi meka yi, ɛmɛnɛ umbafo mbamba umba bɔkɔ o sheyimo mbala wu awu ba o rikwunzu ungwu ɛshɔshi kaa enzu lo du Okrasi ma kwuwongu ɛduma mba. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu zɔ mba idɛnyi yi kaa ɛshɔshi lɛɛbi lo nyama la yi kaa lo yitu te ɛnwu iyi bɔkɔ ki kwu ma yi ele akwu iyesheshi.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Imbwama Laa Wambwalu Umba Bɔkɔ O Yi Igɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ugɔ a kpa mi ma te la mi ka yi kwupwu ungwu imbwama la enzu umba Ukpo umba Ozhudiya fo. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Moo Imi mi yitu te lunyi lu yi egbo iyi imbwama, Imi ba mi kwu ɛnwu ma yi laa enzu umba Omasedoniya, mi za mba te ɔshɔshi uwu Akaya o yi ɛnwu ma iyi imbwama ngbaa kanu, igyakpɔɔ yi i shi egbo iyi enzu gyɔɔ meka mba i yimo kaa lo wo ɛduma. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Kekelele, Imi ba mi lɔ ɛmɛnɛ mbɔlɛ ma kaa ɛnwu ikwumo nzu ma yi la kwu iyi idɔ mo, kaa la lu yi ɛnwu ma kyamate mi zɔ awu. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Moo gba enzu umbafo umba Omasedoniya o zɛ mbala mi akwɛyi o ma te lunyi lu yi ɛnwu ma mo, akwu kinzu kɛɛkyi gba lovya lu wo nzu mo le mo, lunyi tete lovya lu wo yi mo kwuwongu ki fulo egbo ma yi. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Akwu kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba mi ka yi te ishoshi te ɛmɛmbɛnɛ lo to keyi la mi lo so kaa la lu yi ɛnwu ma iyi rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ lu so lu shi mɛzhi te lu shi awu. Akwɛyi akwu rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ lu shi mu egbo yi ikpɛnyi, moo akwu te o kpa yi mega mo.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Lunyi la lu lolo te: Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e so bwɛɛ, a lɔ bwɛɛ, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e so gyɔɔ ba a lɔ gyɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Onzonzu la ka megbo wu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e shi, moo lo kpa wu mega dɛ mo, kwuwongu e be shi ɛnwu wu kwungbɛ mo, moo Ukpo a gyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ e shi rɛshi la egbo ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Ukpo e do te e shi yi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu gyi lɛɛbi kaa la lu yi kiya gyɔɔ kwuyengwunaguna akwɛyi lu wo ɛduma iyesheshi. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Kyamate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ, te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">&lt;&lt;A ka rɛshi wu laa ayirewa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">Ototo wu e yi iyɔkpɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e koko e shi ewiri laa anegba kaa lo somo awu, ba a gba e shi mbo kiya ingyirimo kaa lo ri awu, Ukpo awu tete e shi kaa la lu yi kiya gyɔɔ, kaa la lu fya esheshi kwuwongu ototo uwu bɔkɔ lu wo awu. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Ukpo e shi yi esheshi wu mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna kwuwongu ɛduma iyi imbwama la enzu umbafo iyi bɔkɔ lu yi mu iwomo awu akwɛyi ɛlɛ i shi enzu kaa lo gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuwongu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu wo mbo awu.<verse eid="2CO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Lunyi la lu lolo te gba lu shi kiya lu mbwa la enzu umba Ukpo ma awu, akwu te lu sa mba igɔ mba ma kɛɛkyi mo, kwuwongu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu wo awu, enzu o gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi gyɔɔ tete. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Mu iwomo yi iyi rɛshi ishimo ngyɛlɛ te, enzu o du Ukpo ma kwuwongu lu na iso iyi Ukpo akwɛyi lu mbwalu yi, akwɛyi lu gba lu ka apula iyi bɔkɔ lu yi yi awu ma megbo ikpɛnyi mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi igɔ mbala enzu lɛɛbi. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Akwɛyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o lɛ Ukpo kwuwo yi, o zɔ te o pwu idɛnyi yi gyɔɔ, kwuwongu esheshi iyɛku iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi yi awu. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />La ki gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuwongu rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ onzu e do ngyi i zɔma mo!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu A Gba Opwu Mu Iso Iyi Bɔkɔ O Mu O Lo Wu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Enzu umbafo meka yi o kpa mi ɔfɔ uwu iso isomo kwuyengwu mi yi mbala yi, kwuyengwu mi yi mbala yi mo ba mi ka kwupwu la ekpasu. Imi ba mi kpa yi ɛshɛku mu ɛnyi iyi Okrasi uwu e yi egbo mɛzhi mbala ari iyeshi te, mi gyite la mi za yi te Imi mi kwu onzu u wo ovyo mo mu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki kpolesu. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Enzu umbafo o zɔ te kinzu ki wo apula kyamate enzu umba kwudu tayi, kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba mi bomo mi so mbo iso la ekpasu, shɔɔkɔ la lu shi mi kaa la mi wo yi tayi tete mo. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Kinzu ki yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ kego, ba ki wo kyamate enzu umba kwudu mo. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ewulo iyi ewa nzu i yi kyamate iyi kwudu mo. Ewulo iyi ewa nzu ingyi mbaa Ukpo, i yi ekpasu iyi i shɛkɛ kizɛ ingyi agewa umba Ukpo ma. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Iso iyi lɔmbwu mbala iso iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ i se iso iyi Ukpo mo ki shiriyimo, akwɛyi ki kyo ki yi egbo iyi enzu ma kaa lo lomo la Okrasi. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki mbwalu iso wu lɛɛbi, akwɛyi ki yi ɛnwu ma kaa la ki tu enzu umba bɔkɔ o towo iso wu mo.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Lunyi lu yese kwudu ungwu kiya bi. Gba onzu e yitu ngboro te uwu akwu uwu Okrasti, uwu le yitu te kinzu ki kwu umba Okrasti tete. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Moo imi mafyi mi akwa mi kiya ingyi lovya mo, gba mi kwu ɛnwu kwuwongu idomo iyi bɔkɔ Ɔkwu e shi nzu, idomo ɛlɛ akwu kwuwongu kaa la ki mbo yi mo, Akwu te kaa la ki shiriyimo mo. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />La lu ma te mi ye yi mu iyi ilomo mu kwupwu ungwu bɔkɔ mi ka mi ka yi le mo. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Enzu umbafo yi o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a ka mu epu wu iyɔlu, i gba i yi ekpasu, ɔbulɛ ŋa gba e yi mbala enzu, e yi umwɔ mo, iso wu ba o to yi la ɔlu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Enzu mbamba tayi lo yitu te, apula iyi bɔkɔ ki ka mu epu nzu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki yi mbala yi mo awu, inyi gba ki zɔ yi le kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki yi mbala yi. <verse eid="2CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Kinzu ki do te ki manda ɛnwu nzu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwɔ ɛnwu mba ma awu mo. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o mala esu, akwɛyi o manda ɛnwu mba mbala esu akwu erendo. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Kinzu ba ki kwu ɛnwu iyi ɛduma iwomo mekeka iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu enzu umba Ukpo mo mo, ɛnwu ikwumo nzu akwu mu ɛduma iyi Ukpo e shi nzu ekpasu te la ki wo mekeka yi. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Kinzu gba ki kwu enzu umba bɔkɔ ki ka yi la ilɔ iyesheshi iyi Okrasi keyi la uwewe le, kwuwo kwɔlɛ ɛnwu ikwumo iyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu ikwumo mekeka yi ele akwu pwa. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Kinzu ba ki kwu ɛnwu mu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ enzu umbafo o wo mo. Eyi ifulomo nzu i yi te, ta bɔkɔ ikwu idu lu fulo yi i le mu ibulɔma, ɛduma nzu mekeka yi ba ii kyomo tete. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Akwɛyi kinzu ki zɛ ilɔ iyesheshi iyi Okrasi mu ɛzhi iyifo iyi bɔkɔ akwu ɛzhi yi mo, moo ki gyi te la ki kwu ɛnwu mu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ enzu umbafo o wo mu ɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ akwu iyamba mo. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Gba onzu e kwu ɛnwu, de ba le kwu ɛnwu mu Ɔkwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Moo akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a pwɔ ɛnwu wu ma gba o nyama la wu le mo. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a pwɔ wu ma gba o nyama la wu le.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu Mbala Wa zɛ ilɔ Umba Angba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Lunyi la lu shɔɔkɔ la lu yidu mbala erendo mi kyamate bɔkɔ lu yi mu iwomo-o awu. Shɔɔkɔ la lu yidu mbala mi! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Imi mi wo rise kwuwo yi le kyamate bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo rise kwuwo yi tayi. Imi mi masa yi mbala umesheko uwu bɔkɔ e de yi ɔnzɔnu dɛ mo, uwu bɔkɔ mi shi anu wu la ɔnzɔnu uwufo uwu o ya wu te Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi tayi. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Iyi mi ba i yi te enzu umbafo o to yi egbo mo akwɛyi lu mbwalu ɔgwuzɛ ongbulolo uwu Okrasi la egbo ikpɛnyi fo kyamate bɔkɔ ɔkwu e kyoro Ivu ma mu amasa tayi. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Moo kwuyengwunanguna bɔkɔ ugboga e bo munyi yi laa iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi owa uwu bɔkɔ akwu uwu kinzu ki so yi iso wu awu mo, lu na yi lasaasa; tatayi lu na kwundu ungufo ungwu bɔkɔ kwu yi kyaa mbala Kwundu uwu Ukpo mo mbala iso iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ i zɛ kyaa mbala iyi bɔkɔ lu na munyi nzu awu mo! <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Imi mi nyama te enzu mbɔlɛ umba bɔkɔ o ya ɛmba te &lt;&lt;wa zɛ ilɔ umbakwu&gt;&gt; awu, o ka mi ma mo! <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Igbomo mi bamba mu iso isomo mo, tetete mi yi iyitu; kinzu ba ki zɔ yi ɛlɛ lɛɛbi-e mu ɛgwuzɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Imi mi ngbomo re bɔkɔ mi gba la ɛmi mɛzhi mu anu itama iyi iso iyesheshi iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ rɛshi kaka kaa la lu so kadu? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Kwuyengu mi yi mu ɛduma iwomo mbala yi awu, ɛshɔshi iyifo gba i shi mi eduwo le. I yi kyamate mi mi wumba ɛlɔ te kaa la mi mbwa yi ma.<verse eid="2CO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Kwuyengu mi yi mbala yi ba mi yi ugɔ uwu eduwo, mi nyama tee la mi fulo yi ɔlu mo; ɛmɛnɛ umba bɔkɔ o ngyi mu Omasedoniya, o ka mi laa kiya ingyinangyina ingyi mi yi ugɔ ngyi lɛɛbi. Mate mi wo mekyi awu, tegba mi wo le iyɔkpɔɔ: mi nyama tee la mi fulo yi ɔlu mo. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Laa ongbulolo uwu Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ e yi ma mi ele, mi so yi tee onzu uwunawuna mu ɛzhi iyi Akaya lɛɛbi e do tee a nyi mi ɛnwukumo mi ɛlɛ mo. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Akwu kwuwongu mi gyi yi mo gba mi so ɛlɛ le? Ukpo e yitu tee mi gyi yi!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu iwomo le gba mi so wu mu iwomo le, kaa mu iwomo mi ɛlɛ, &lt;&lt;wa zɛ ilɔ&gt;&gt; umbafo mbamba lo fya kapa kaa lo kwɛnwu tee o yi mu ɛduma iwomo mate kinzu tete. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Enzu mbamba tayi akwu wa zɛ ilɔ umba ongbulolo mo-akwu wazilɔ umba angba, umba bɔkɔ o mwilo mekeka iyi ɛduma mba akwɛyi o wo kyamate umba akwu wa zɛ ilɔ shɛ umba Okrasi tayi. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Ɛlɛ akwu kiya ingyi kenzu iyama mo! Moo onzu uwoyi mafyi wu tete e wo mate uwu akwu ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu ɛbɛ tayi. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ la kwanzu kiya ingyi kenzu iyama mo gba ɛmɛgba wu o wo mate umba akwu ɛmɛgba umba ototo tayi. Ɔnuwu kwɔnyi kwɔlɛ, ɔ lɔ kiya ingyi o so awu.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyashi Iyi Ɔpɔlu A Ma Mu Ɛduma Wu Iyi U zɛ ilɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />La mi so yi kpɔ tee: Onzu uwunawuna le to mi tee mi kwu orondo mo. Ishi gba lu to mi tayi, ba la lu na mi mate o na orondo tayi, kaa Imi tete la mi fya kiya ingyi kwɛnwu mangyi bwɛɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Mu iso iyi ɛnwukumo ɛlɛ, ewo iyi bɔkɔ orondo e so iso gba mi mondo le, moo akwu tayi gba Ɔkwu e so le mo. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Kwuwongwu enzu gyɔɔ o kwɛnwu kyamate enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o kwu awu, Imi tete mi kwu. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Lunyi lu yi amasa gyɔɔ, akwɛyi lu nyama laa erendo la ɔnyɛ! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Lakwu tayi mo kɔ, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e bo te kaa le wo yi enye wu, nana kaa le kyoro yi mo akwɛyi a na yi eduwo mo, nana kaa la zhi yi ma, nana kaa le so yi afyi meyi, lu na wu ewo epo le? <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Akwa mi kiya ingyi lovya kaa la mi nyama tee kinzu ki wiyi iyi apula ɛnyi tayi iwomo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Kiya ingyinangyina ingyi onzu uwufo e kwɛnwu mangyi ba, Imi mi kwu tete. Imi mi so iso mate orondo tayi. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Umba akwu Iburu le? Imi tete mi kwu Iburu. Umba akwu ɛmɛ umba Isirɛ le? Imi tete mi kwu umɛ uwu Isirɛ. Umba ɔ wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Aburamu le? Imi tete mi wɔ ma yi. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Umba akwu ɛmɛgba umba Okrasi le? Mi so iso mate ukporishi tayi, tetete mi ka mba ma lɛɛbi mu ɛlɛ! Moo ɛduma iyi mi wo, i ka iyamba ma, moo o ta mi mu ugu ugyi izhi ngbɛ ngbɛ-ɛ, o kpa mi ikpa iyɛkɔkɔ ngbɛ-ɛ, Imi mi ma lukwu mu eyi ba mi ma-a.<verse eid="2CO 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Azhu ɔ kpa mi ikpa uwekpela la erendo izhɛlɔ; <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Aroma o kpa mi ikpa izhɛla; kwuye kwukpɛnyi o to mi ekyi. Kwɔda ungwembyi kwu fulo mi mo izhɛla dɛ-ɛ, mi wo awa uwo ekpepo la endo mu risu dɛ-ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Iyɔkpɔɔ mi yi mu luzɛ. Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, mi fye mu kumbɛ gyɔɔ mbaa risu isama, mbaa awɛlɔ, mbaa ɛmɛnɛ mi Azhu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo; mu ese ikikɔ ikikɔ, mu akata mbala ɛmɛza umba angba. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Kwuye ungufo mi kpondo mo kwuwongu ɛduma; kwuye ungufo mi to afyi gyɔɔ mi ri mo ba mi wo mo; kwuye ungufo mi yi kiya ingyirimo, nana kizɛ ingyi inɔma, nana ekpayi iyi ikpo mɛnwu iyi bɔkɔ i do mi mo mo. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Iyi bɔkɔ i kyo mu ɛlɛ lɛɛbi gba akwu ɔlu uwu bɔkɔ u yi mu reshi mi uwu eyi ibɔma mu ɛshɔshi lɛɛbi kwɔfyi kwɔfyi le. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Moo uwe bɔkɔ ekpasu i nyɛ wu ma, ba mi mbwa wu ma mo? Uwe bɔkɔ o shi wu e ngbomo, ba mi wo amba mu egbo mi mo?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Gba mi kwɛnwu lala, mi kwu mu apula iyi bɔkɔ i zɔ tee mi yi ekpasu iyi iwomo mo. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Ki du ɛnyi iyi Ukpo ma iyɔkpɔ, uwu bɔkɔ akwu ete wu Ɔkwu nzu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi awu! moo e yitu te akwu angba gba mi yi mu imuma le mo.<verse eid="2CO 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Kwuye ungwu mi yi mu kwuse ungwu Ɔdamasikɔ awu, Ɔsu Aretasi a za la ogomina te le shi wa gbomo mu lunzugu undu ɔbɛ uwu kwuse munamuna kaa la fya le yi mi mo. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Ɛmɛza mi ba o lo mi mu kibiri ingyɛkwu akwɛyi o wa mi ma mu ɔtu uwu ɔbɛ akwɛyi mi wirima mu ewo wu.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Ɛbɛ Iyi Ɔpɔlu A Ma Mbala Inyashi Wu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ɛnwu ikwumo ɛlɛ te i mbwama la uwewe mo, tetete mi kwu yi. Imi mi ŋi so apula iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a zɔ mi mu ɛbɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Lɔri luwo la londo undu lu kama le, mi yi onzu uwufo u mbwalu Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ o to wu o kawa mosho-oshi mbaa bɔkɔ Ukpo e yi le. Shi akwu ɛnwu wu gba o to yi le, nana akwu kwundu wu gba o to ngwu le, mi yitu mo, Ukpo gba e yitu le. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Imi mi yitu iyi onzu ele,shii akwu ɛnwu iyi onzu ele, nana kwundu wu gba o to le, mi yitu mo, Ukpo kɛɛkyi gba e yitu le, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />iyi mi yitu gba i yi te Ukpo e to wu mo a kawa mu oparadasi. Mɔmɔ a pwa iso iyi bɔkɔ onzu uwu inyi igyi e do yi isomo mo, ba ɔ nyama te onzu le so yi mo. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Onzu awu tayi gba mi kwɛnwu ma wu le. Imi ba mi kwɛnwu mu ɛduma mi mo. Shii mi kwɛnwu ba mi kwu mu apula iyi i zɔ ifɔma mi. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Gba mi gyi te la mi kwɛnwu lala, mi wo mate orondo mo, kwuwongu mi so yi ongbulolo. Imi ba mi ŋi nyama te la mi kwɛnwu mo, moo mi gyi te enzu lo to mi la ɔlu uwu bɔkɔ u ka ɛduma iyi mi wo nana iso iyi mi so awu ma mo.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Kwuwongwu kaa la mi kwɛnwu mu apula iyi izele iyi Ukpo a zɔ mi mu ɛbɛ mo, o bɔ mi kiya kyamate owula uwakwu mu ɛnwu mi, o kyo ɔ lɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu onzu uwoyi kaa le koko le lo mi inyashi kaa la mi kwu ɛnwu mo. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Imi mi kpa Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi ɛshɛku izhɛla te le to mi inyashi ɛlɛ ma. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Uwu ba a za mi te, &lt;&lt;Esheshi mi i do ŋɔ mo, moo ɛlɛ gba i zɔ ekpasu mi gedegede le.&gt;&gt; Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, mi gyakpɔɔ mu ɛnwu ikwumo mu apula iyi bɔkɔ i mu mi ekpasu ma kaa ekpasu iyi Okrasi li koko li yi mbala mi iyɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Akwu kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba mi mwɔnyɛ mbala inyɛma iyi ekpasu mi, mbala ari iyi enzu ɔ kpa mi, mbala inyashi iyi enzu o lo mi kwuwongu ɛnyi iyi Okrasi le. Moo kwuyengwu ekpasu mi i fɔma gba mi fya ekpasu mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi le.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aka Itama Iyi Ɔpɔlu Kwuwongwu Wambwalu Umba Ɔkɔrɛtiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Lunyi lu shi mi wo ɛmi orondo. Imi mi kwu kiya kinyinyi mo, tetete i fate la lu pwɔ mi ma, moo &lt;&lt;wa zɛ ilɔ umba angba&gt;&gt; mbɔlɛ o koshi la mi mo. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Apula iyi bɔkɔ i zɔ te onzu ele akwu uzilɔ uwu Ukpo gba akwu: Lɔzɔ undu izele mbala apula iyi amɛ iwomo le. Ɛlɛ lɛɛbi ba mi yidu akwɛyi Ukpo e shi mi wo yi mekeka yi. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Mu ɔgwuzɛ uwuna bɔkɔ mi zɔ yi te lunyi lu ba ɛshɔshi iyifo mo? Nana kwuwongu bɔkɔ mi na eduwo mbaa ɛshɔshi iyifo ɛlɛ kaa la mi wo ɛduma le ŋa? Mi gyi te la mi fulo yi ɔlu mo le bi. lu ma te mi ngbo yi mo mu ɛlɛ de, ba la lu gba yi kpa mi!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Lunyi la lu pwa! Imi mi yi mu iwomo kaa la mi bo munyi yi izhi ungwɔla kpɔ. Gba mi bo, mi ŋi fulo yi ɔlu mo. Mi ŋi nyɔ kwuwo yi, moo akwu kwuwongu kiya ingyi kwuwo yi mo. Umbada mbala umbɛnɛ gba ifate lo shi kiya mɛzhi la ɛmɛ mba le, moo akwu ɛmɛ gba o shi kiya mɛzhi la umbete mbo mbala umbanyimba le mo. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, i shi mi ɔnyɛ gyɔɔ kaa kiya ingyi mi yi ngyi lɛɛbi la mi ngbɛ ngyi ma kwuwo yi, mi kyo mi ra la ɛmi mi shi yi tete. Shii bɔkɔ mi kpo lukwu yi gyɔɔ te le, lunyi ba lu kpo undami bwɛɛ mo?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Imi mi yitu lu nyama te mi fulo yi ɔlu mo, tetete, enzu umbafo ɔ zɔ te Imi mi kwu u kyoro enzu kaa la mi na mba kiya ma. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Mɛmi iyi enzu umba mi lɔ mba ma munyi yi ele, onzu uwu mi lɔ wu kaa la na kiya munyi yi mu amasa e yi? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Mi za la Ɔtayitɔ te le so munyi yi, akwɛyi mi lɔ umanyinzu u mbwalu kaa la zɛ mbala wu. Ɔtayitɔ e ri yi ozawu re? A kwu ɔgwuzɛ ukpɛnyi gba ki mbwalu gba ki wo mbala yi le mo re?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Lunyi lu yi mu egbo ibyima te iso iyi ki so ngbɛɛ le, akwiyi ki gyi te la ki gbɔ enzu ma munyi yi le? Ɛmɛza mi, iso iyi ki so le, a kwiyi enzu wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, ba akwu mu idu iyi Ukpo gba ki yi mu isomo le; Kiya ingyinangyina ingyi ki wo, ki wo te kaa la ki kyo yi ekpasu ma le. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Iyi mi gba i yi te kwuyengwu mi bi nyɔ munyi yi awu, igbomo mi du yi mu luzɛ undu mi gyi mo, lunyi tete igbomo lu gyi kiya ingyi mi bi wo mo. Mi wiyi te igbomo mi du yi mu itumo, mu anya iwomo iyi esu, mu amba umbira iwomo, mu ikama, mu iso iyira isomo iyi esu, mu esu ikyɛma mbala i zɔ i ka le mbala kizɛ i fo yika munamuna. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Imi mi wiyi te kwuyengwu mi bi nyɔ munyi yi kpɔ, lovya lu wo mi mo mu idu iyi Edego-ala uwu mi mbwalu kwuwongu luzɛ yi. Mi nyima gyɔɔ kwuwongu enzu umba bɔkɔ o ngbomo dɛ-ɛ ba o towo i ta mɛzhi, ba o degbo mu apula iyi kashi iwomo mbala iyama mbala ekweyi iyi iyama iyi o yi ma yi mekyekyi awu.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Itumo Iyi Ɔpɔlu Imbwambwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Inyɔma mi munyi yi akwu kwuzhi ungwɔla gba kwu ŋɔ le. Kyamate bɔkɔ iso iyi Ukpo i so, &lt;&lt;Gba izɔgɔ iyi azɔgɔ wepo nana wala i zɛ kya mbala esu, iso ɛnyi i rima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Kwuye ungwu mi ka munyi yi izhi ungwopo awu, mi tu yi mo dɛ-ɛ. Mi gba mi so yi kpɔ kwuye kwɔlɛ bɔkɔ mi yi mbala yi fo le te: Gba mi gba mi bo akwɛyi mi du onzu uwufo mu ingbomo kpɔ, mi ŋi ma inyashi iyi onzu awu tayi fo, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />moo lu zɔ te lu gyi te la lu ma kɛzɔ unga bɔkɔ ka zɔ te Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi gba e yi mu iso isomo mami le. Ɔzhizɔsi akwu usuwa mo, moo ekpasu wu i yi mu izɔma munyi yi. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Moo kwuwongu bɔkɔ inyɛma iyi ekpasu iyi onzu gba i yi mbala wu le kwuye kwɔngu awu, akwɛyi o kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi, ɔ ngbɛ wu ma. Tetete e yi lakwunyɔ ŋa moo Edego-ala a zɔ ekpasu wu akwɛyi e yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ. Tatayi, kinzu umba bɔkɔ ki yi mbala wu awu, ki yi ekpasu mo tete.Tetete mu ekpasu iyi Ukpo, kinzu tete ki ri mawu akwɛyi ki wo yi ɛduma.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Lalu yese ɛnwu yi ma kaa lu ma shii lu yi mu luzɛ undu ikwu idu lu fulo; La lu mondo ɛnwu yi ma. Lunyi lu yitu te Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e yi ma yi mo? Naa lu kwu wa mbwalu ngboro mo ŋa? <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Imi mi shi egbo te, lu ma te kinzu ki kwu wa zɛ ilɔ umba Ukpo kego. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Kinzu ki lɛ Ukpo te la mbwa yi ma kaa la lu wo kiya ingyira mo. Ɛlɛ ki so te kaa enzu lo ma te ɛduma nzu i she la Ukpo marimari le mo. Ki gyi te gba enzu o ma nzu te ki fɔma lala, lunyi de la lu zɛ luzɛ undesheshi mbaa Ukpo. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Moo kinzu ki wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki zɛ kya mbala ototo mo mo, ototo gba ki ri ma wu le iyɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Kwuye ungwunanguna bɔkɔ ki kpɔfɔ lunyi ba lu yi ekpasu ki mwɔnyɛ. Ki gba ki lɛ Ukpo te la lu nyɔlɔ ma. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ɛlɛ gba i shi mi ka yi ɛlɛ le, kaa kwuye ungwu mi bi nyɔ munyi yi awu, mi ra la ekpasu iyi Ukpo e shi mi awu akwɛyi mi kpa yi ɛyi zhazha fo, moo ekpasu iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mi, a kwiyi kaa lo mbo yi mo le, moo akwu kaa lo shiri yi mo mo.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, iso mi imbwambwa gba i yi te, la lu mwɔnyɛ. Lalu nɔngɔ luzɛ yi ma. Lalu mbwalu iso iyi mi so yi. Egbo yi lakwu ikpɛnyi, lalu ŋɔ moloto. Edego-ala, u kpo lukwu undu enzu, u shi iŋɔma iyi oloto, le yi mbala yi.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Lalu gbɛlɛ esu ɛnyi, la lu kpa esu idu. Wambwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala mi munɛ lɛɛbi o ye yi mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Esheshi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, mbala idɛnyi iyi Edego-ala mbala iŋɔma kya mbala esu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo li yi mbala yi lɛɛbi.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>